            <div class="tjs-policy-item">
              <div class="tjs-policy-icon">1</div>
              <div class="tjs-policy-copy">
                <strong>Damaged item? Inform us quickly.</strong>
                If your order arrives damaged, share clear photos/videos of the product and box within 2 days/48 hours of delivery so our team can assist with replacement or store credit.
              </div>
