                <strong>Return requests need approval.</strong>
                Return requests must be raised within 2 days of delivery. Our support team reviews every request before approving the next step.
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="tjs-policy-item">
              <div class="tjs-policy-icon">3</div>
              <div class="tjs-policy-copy">
                <strong>Returned items must pass quality check.</strong>
                Products should be unused, in original condition and packed properly with original packaging, tags and invoice wherever applicable.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="tjs-product-tabs__note">
